msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/fill_between.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.fill_between.fill_between:33
msgid ""
"Draw legend entries as colored lines instead of filled boxes. By default, "
"legend entries use ``fill`` and ``fill2`` for the box fills and ``pen`` and "
"``pen2`` for the box outlines. Set ``legend_pen=True`` to switch to colored "
"lines that use the fill colors. Pass a pen thickness to control the legend "
"line thickness.  .. note::      Due to an upstream GMT bug (https://github."
"com/GenericMappingTools/gmt/pull/9070),     GMT <= 6.6.0 always uses a "
"``2.5p`` pen thickness for these legend lines,     regardless of the value "
"passed to ``legend_pen``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/fill_between.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.fill_between.fill_between:33
msgid ""
"Draw legend entries as colored lines instead of filled boxes. By default, "
"legend entries use ``fill`` and ``fill2`` for the box fills and ``pen`` and "
"``pen2`` for the box outlines. Set ``legend_pen=True`` to switch to colored "
"lines that use the fill colors. Pass a pen thickness to control the legend "
"line thickness."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/fill_between.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.fill_between.fill_between:40
msgid ""
"Due to an upstream GMT bug (https://github.com/GenericMappingTools/gmt/"
"pull/9070), GMT <= 6.6.0 always uses a ``2.5p`` pen thickness for these "
"legend lines, regardless of the value passed to ``legend_pen``."
msgstr ""

